X-WEBMS-FIXTURE-NOTE:What this proves: a Monday/Wednesday/Friday series created on a WEDNESDAY must not gain
X-WEBMS-FIXTURE-NOTE:a Monday it never had. The first week of a weekly rule is worked out as a whole week, so
X-WEBMS-FIXTURE-NOTE:the Monday before the series began is offered and has to be thrown away. Seven dates,
X-WEBMS-FIXTURE-NOTE:starting Wednesday 9 September 2026 - never Monday the 7th.
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:midweek-start-1@fixtures.webms.test
DTSTAMP:20260901T090000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260909T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260909T110000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=MO,WE,FR;COUNT=7
SUMMARY:Midweek prayer
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
